        "cooked": "<p>I love watching the tournaments. I learned much watching others and seeing what they are doing. I was wondering since Chris make a custom map, if maybe someone could post a good picture of the map, so that I can look at the map closer and see why the people in the tournemant made that move, or even help me follow along with hex count.&nbsp; In the video, I can't see evelation so if there was a picture i could print out and pause the youtube and find it on my printout, it would help me greatly to follow along the action and improve my game.</p>",
